B.Df=s([B.G3,B.FV,B.FN,B.G_],t.e)
B.Gk=new A.fi("STAYING SANE","A calm plant is nearly restful. Trouble is what wears you down \u2014 and when you are already failing, the building starts screaming. Every scream costs 5 sanity. At zero you walk out.",B.Df)
B.FG=new A.aY("THE STRIP","A malfunction takes over the strip above the panels and stays there. The bar on the right fills while you are doing the right thing, and empties when you stop.")
B.G9=new A.aY("HOLDING IT","Nothing clears the moment you flip a switch. You have to hold the answer for a while, because that is what recovery is.")
B.FC=new A.aY("PUMP TRIP","A loop drops out. Get two loops back, or bring power under 40% until it is racked back in.")
B.Ge=new A.aY("JAMMED BANK","One bank stops answering. Fly the core on boron alone and keep the startup rate near zero.")
B.G5=new A.aY("VACUUM DECAY","Megawatts fall with the throttle untouched. Back it under 40% and let the condenser recover.")
B.FK=new A.aY("FEED PUMP TRIP","The generator boils dry fast. AFW START on the SAFETY panel.")
B.FR=new A.aY("STUCK PORV","The relief opens on its own and bleeds you down. Shut it on COOLANT. Watch the annunciator, not the clock.")
B.FA=new A.aY("TUBE LEAK","Activity crosses to the steam side. Ramp under 25% power.")
B.FB=new A.aY("FLUX CHANNEL","A meter lies. Everything else says you are fine. Hold what you have \u2014 tripping the plant is the failure, not the fix.")
B.FT=new A.aY("BLACKOUT","The grid drops you and the breaker locks out. EDG START, then resynchronise.")
